N1  - <p>BOINC criterion evidence - Abstract, verbatim: "To overcome computational constraints inherent in this method, a distributed computing project was created for parallel computation. In addition to its use in gravitational lensing simulation, a description of the setup and function of this distributed computing project is presented as an alternative to in-house computing clusters, which has the added benefit of public enrollment in science and low cost." | Full text: PhD thesis, University of Missouri-St. Louis (2010) | Link: BRaTS@Home / BOINC | Source: ADS bibcode 2010PhDT.......285CER&nbsp;&nbsp;-</p>
